I'll give you the complete Vue 3 + Spring Boot + MongoDB hotel booking CRUD application, using your preferred simple structure: no service class, only model, repository, and controller.

The application will let you:

- Add rooms and view all rooms.
- Add bookings for existing rooms.
- Automatically increase the room's booking count and update its status.
- Display bookings alongside room details.
- Delete bookings and update the room's count and status.
- Edit booking details.

